    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7(1)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      88.32,
      481.27,
      295.36,
      503.36
    ],
    "text": "My Ref. No.: KDS/PDB/4/3/10(iv).Land Ministry's Reference No.: 4-3/11/2017/UD/172.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      515.6,
      295.5,
      561.68
    ],
    "text": "I, do hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends toacquire the following land which is required for a publicpurpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.28,
      572.95,
      225.04,
      583.04
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      589.04,
      295.47,
      659.11
    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land Lot No. 01 in total extent of about0.0008 hectares, depicted in the Preliminary Plan Maha/6911,surveyed and prepared by the senior surveyor superintendentof Kandy for Surveyor General and situated in the village ofWalala in Pallegampaha Korale minor division of PathadumbaraDivision in Kandy District, Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      666.12,
      295.14,
      699.43
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Kankaniyage Kumbura Wanatha; Extent:0.0008 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      706.16,
      295.32,
      740.23
    ],
    "text": "North: Road (Road Development Authority) and Lot No. 61 inPP/Maha/6394; East: Lot No. 60 and 61 in PP/Maha/6394 andKankaniyage Kumbura claimed by W.M.P.N. Wahindara;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      440.0,
      547.54,
      486.08
    ],
    "text": "South: Kankaniyage Kumbura claimed by W.M.P.N. Wahindaraand forest adjacent to Kankaniyage Kumbura claimed byK.A.N.W. Nanayakkara; West: forest adjacent to KankaniyageKumbura claimed by K.A.N.W. Nanayakkara and channel.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      494.0,
      546.89,
      516.08
    ],
    "text": "Names and Addresses of the claimants: K.A.N.W.Nanayakkara, No. 174, 8th Mile Post, Walala, Menikhinna.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      525.2,
      547.46,
      643.28
    ],
    "text": "I do hereby give public notice that all persons interested inthe aforesaid lands are required to appear before mepersonally, or by agents duly authorized in writing atDivisional Secretariat Pathadumbara on 29 day of May 2019,at 10.00 a.m. in the morning and they are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing with duplicates on or before 22 day ofMay 2019, the nature of their interests in the aforesaid land,and the amount and the particulars of their claims forcompensation and the details of the computation of suchamount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
